        "content": "## Resume Processing Workflow\n\n## Overview\nThis part of the workflow handles the extraction of text from applicant resumes submitted via Google Forms. It performs the following steps:\n\n\n### 1. Code\n  - Extracts the Google Drive file ID from the resume link submitted in the form.\n\n### 2. Download Resume\n  - Downloads the resume file from Google Drive using the `fileId` extracted in the previous node.\n\n### 3. Extract Resume PDF\n  - Extracts text content from the downloaded PDF resume.",
