      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Resume Screening\n\n## Overview\nIt uses the applicant’s form submission, resume text, and job requirements to decide if the candidate should be shortlisted or rejected.\n\n### 1. HR Recruiter (AI Node)\n  - Acts as an AI recruiter to review the candidate.\n  - Steps performed:\n    1. Read the candidate’s extracted resume text.\n    2. Identify the position applied for.\n    3. Retrieve job requirements for the position.\n    4. Compare candidate background to requirements.\n    5. Decide status: \"Shortlisted\" or \"Rejected\".\n    6. Generate a summary explanation for the decision.",
