    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Conditional Workflow: Shortlisted Candidates\n\n## Overview\nThis part of the workflow checks the applicant's status after the HR Recruiter AI has reviewed the application. Depending on whether the candidate is shortlisted, the workflow can trigger further actions\n\n### 1. Get Applicant Status\n  - Retrieves the latest status of the applicant from the response spreadsheet.\n\n### 2. If Candidate is Shortlisted\n  - Checks if the candidate’s status is `Shortlisted`.\n  - **True branch:** Candidate is shortlisted → trigger next steps (e.g., interview scheduling, sending email).\n  - **False branch:** Candidate is not shortlisted → end or trigger rejection workflow.",
        "height": 672,
        "width": 496
      },
